The management console vendors four icons from Microsoft's Azure architecture
icon set (https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/architecture/icons/) under
src/Portal/wwwroot/img/azure/: Load Balancer, Virtual Machine Scale Set, Public
IP Prefix and Virtual Network. Microsoft licenses these icons for use in
architecture diagrams and technical documentation, subject to the terms on that
page; they are not covered by this repository's own licence and they are not
Microsoft trademarks licensed for any other use.

public-ip-prefix.svg carries one deliberate correction to Microsoft's original,
which ships two gradients with no stops and renders two thirds invisible. The
file documents the change in place.

